antum particle orbit ring in the center with a faint Tai Chi yin-yang emerging inside, the two overlapping and merging, clean minimal background with generous negative space. The camera slowly pushes in with small amplitude at slow speed, the quantum ring gently rotates and glows. [Shot 2] At 00:05.000, the camera cuts to three minimalist physicist silhouettes standing in the lower frame, looking up at floating Taoist bamboo slips and Tai Chi diagrams, faceless silhouettes, haze blue main tone with pale golden light dots. The camera slowly pans right, light dots gently drift downward. [Shot 3] At 00:10.000, the camera cuts to a minimalist male scholar side profile silhouette in the center, hand on chin in thinking pose, glowing abstract ancient text symbols floating above his head, warm gray gradient background, quantum waveform lines surrounding the figure. The waveform lines extend outward and fade into the transition.\n\noverall_soundscape: Subtle ambient atmospheric hum, soft electronic undertones, gentle chime accents as light dots drift.\nnon_diegetic_music: Soft sustained ambient pads at a slow tempo, meditative and contemplative mood, gradually warming toward the end.\n"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Input Text (Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [370, 390], "pos": [-1488.5052490234375, 6566.33984375], "id": 138, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.33.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 10}, {"outputs": [{"name": "FLOAT", "links": [261], "label": "FLOAT", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "FLOAT"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [15], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveFloat", "title": "Float (Duration se